    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Valid Insurance Certificate</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The original insurance policy document that covers the bike for road transit. It must be active and reflect the current policy period.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">04</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA‑Approved Consignment Bilty</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">A consignment bilty issued by the Indian Bureau of Shipping (IBA) or an authorized shipping agent, confirming the bike’s consignment details, destination, and handling instructions.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p>Each of these documents plays a distinct role:</p>

<ul>
<li>The RC establishes ownership and vehicle details.</li>
<li>The PUC ensures environmental compliance and permits road passage.</li>
<li>The insurance certificate protects against accidental damage or theft during transit.</li>
<li>The consignment bilty acts as a freight agreement, detailing responsibilities of the carrier and the consignor.</li>
</ul>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">While the above papers cover regulatory compliance, the most critical safeguard for marine transit is the 100% declared‑value marine transit insurance.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This insurance covers the bike for its full market value in case of loss, damage, or theft while on the water.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Unlike standard road policies, marine transit insurance specifically addresses risks such as capsizing, collision, or rough sea conditions.</span></li></ul>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">It also offers indemnity for any liabilities that may arise from the vehicle’s presence on a vessel.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Ensuring that this insurance is in place, and that the declared value matches the bike’s actual market worth, eliminates the risk of under‑insurance and guarantees that the consignor can recover the full cost of the bike if an incident occurs.</span></li></ul>

<p>In summary, for a smooth and legally compliant bike transport in Darbhanga, always carry a self‑attested RC photocopy, a current PUC certificate, a valid insurance certificate, and an IBA‑approved consignment bilty. Pair these with a 100% declared‑value marine transit insurance to protect your investment throughout the journey.</p></div>
